<title>BELGIUM: FOCUS-EU ministers give Belgian EMU plan good marks.</title>
<headline>FOCUS-EU ministers give Belgian EMU plan good marks.</headline>
<byline>Geert De Clercq</byline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's efforts to get its budget in order for economic and monetary union (EMU) won a seal of approval from its European Union partners on Monday.</p>
<p>European Union finance ministers said a plan to reduce further the Belgian budget deficit and debt mountain by 2000</p>
</text>
